          "document_end": 161,
          "text": "对于碰撞过程，普遍关心的问题有两个：一是碰撞前后碰撞体速度的变化规律，另一个是碰撞力的变化规律。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 113,
          "end": 161,
          "chunk_start": 113,
          "chunk_end": 161,
          "sentence_document_start": 113,
          "sentence_document_end": 161,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1245a87f56282b408f89",
          "document_start": 161,
          "document_end": 198,
          "text": "对于碰撞问题，研究者们进行了长期的研究，并出现了不同的处理方法和碰撞模型。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 161,
          "end": 198,
          "chunk_start": 161,
          "chunk_end": 198,
          "sentence_document_start": 161,
          "sentence_document_end": 198,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4880f64b38c2ca108e1e",
          "document_start": 198,
          "document_end": 220,
          "text": "下面首先对碰撞动力学的各种处理模型进行介绍。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 198,
          "end": 220,
          "chunk_start": 198,
          "chunk_end": 220,
          "sentence_document_start": 198,
          "sentence_document_end": 220,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4a587ac511177194c16d",
          "document_start": 222,
          "document_end": 242,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 222,
          "end": 242,
          "chunk_start": 222,
          "chunk_end": 242,
          "sentence_document_start": 222,
          "sentence_document_end": 242,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1ed6c21b8c6625386f4e",
          "document_start": 243,
          "document_end": 254,
          "text": "# 1）经典力学方法;",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 243,
          "end": 254,
          "chunk_start": 243,
          "chunk_end": 254,
          "sentence_document_start": 243,
          "sentence_document_end": 254,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1da60838f8816167e83e",
          "document_start": 255,
          "document_end": 287,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 255,
          "end": 287,
          "chunk_start": 255,
          "chunk_end": 287,
          "sentence_document_start": 255,
          "sentence_document_end": 287,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f8010df32028588f1fc4",
          "document_start": 289,
          "document_end": 330,
          "text": "经典力学是利用动量守恒定律研究碰撞问题的，因此，动量守恒定律是经典碰撞理论的基础。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 289,
          "end": 330,
          "chunk_start": 289,
          "chunk_end": 330,
          "sentence_document_start": 289,
          "sentence_document_end": 330,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a34cabf13e798cc9e248",
          "document_start": 330,
          "document_end": 392,
          "text": "该理论假设碰撞物体是完全刚性，碰撞持续时间为0，可以用来解决完全弹性碰撞和完全非弹性碰撞问题，但大多数碰撞是处于二者之间的。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 330,
          "end": 392,
          "chunk_start": 330,
          "chunk_end": 392,
          "sentence_document_start": 330,
          "sentence_document_end": 392,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_fc696738074d12b30885",
          "document_start": 392,
          "document_end": 481,
          "text": "为此，牛顿引入恢复系数来研究碰撞过程中能量的损失及碰撞前后物体速度的变化，认为碰撞前后相对速度的比为常数，且该常数与碰撞物体的材料性质有关，与物体的形状、大小与碰撞前的速度无关。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 392,
          "end": 481,
          "chunk_start": 392,
          "chunk_end": 481,
          "sentence_document_start": 392,
          "sentence_document_end": 481,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d1b608ab512a7dfa8955",
          "document_start": 483,
          "document_end": 503,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 483,
          "end": 503,
          "chunk_start": 483,
          "chunk_end": 503,
          "sentence_document_start": 483,
          "sentence_document_end": 503,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b290cec4f5cc89e34e6b",
          "document_start": 504,
          "document_end": 515,
          "text": "# 1）经典力学方法;",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 504,
          "end": 515,
          "chunk_start": 504,
          "chunk_end": 515,
          "sentence_document_start": 504,
          "sentence_document_end": 515,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_25ef2dce372d1af03cdd",
          "document_start": 516,
          "document_end": 548,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 516,
          "end": 548,
          "chunk_start": 516,
          "chunk_end": 548,
          "sentence_document_start": 516,
          "sentence_document_end": 548,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_926d09a5e1b0572d5607",
          "document_start": 550,
          "document_end": 599,
          "text": "经典力学不能用来解决碰撞过程中碰撞力大小的变化规律，在不关心碰撞力变化的情况下这种方法还是有效的。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 550,
          "end": 599,
          "chunk_start": 550,
          "chunk_end": 599,
          "sentence_document_start": 550,
          "sentence_document_end": 599,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_43ad0c2de5685067ec66",
          "document_start": 599,
          "document_end": 629,
          "text": "泊松模型方法是采用经典力学来解决碰撞问题常用的模型处理方法。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 599,
          "end": 629,
          "chunk_start": 599,
          "chunk_end": 629,
          "sentence_document_start": 599,
          "sentence_document_end": 629,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0541132c9b5d4e11329e",
          "document_start": 629,
          "document_end": 672,
          "text": "该方法认为，碰撞在瞬间完成，通过求解一系列线性代数方程确定碰撞前后系统广义速度的变化。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 629,
          "end": 672,
          "chunk_start": 629,
          "chunk_end": 672,
          "sentence_document_start": 629,
          "sentence_document_end": 672,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4c37a032c44fff883bcb",
          "document_start": 672,
          "document_end": 711,
          "text": "在求解过程中，不用积分，计算效率高，但是碰撞力计算不够精确，容易出现较大偏差。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 672,
          "end": 711,
          "chunk_start": 672,
          "chunk_end": 711,
          "sentence_document_start": 672,
          "sentence_document_end": 711,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_947f8851cff3398c5f11",
          "document_start": 711,
          "document_end": 771,
          "text": "此外，恢复系数取值是否准确也是碰撞问题求解的关键，实际上，恢复系数不仅与碰撞体材料有关，还与两物体的运动和动力参数有关。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 711,
          "end": 771,
          "chunk_start": 711,
          "chunk_end": 771,
          "sentence_document_start": 711,
          "sentence_document_end": 771,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_20a30f1ba64dbadf824c",
          "document_start": 773,
          "document_end": 793,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 773,
          "end": 793,
          "chunk_start": 773,
          "chunk_end": 793,
          "sentence_document_start": 773,
          "sentence_document_end": 793,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_cb2db68cfb2884271bda",
          "document_start": 794,
          "document_end": 805,
          "text": "# 2）碰撞力学方法;",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 794,
          "end": 805,
          "chunk_start": 794,
          "chunk_end": 805,
          "sentence_document_start": 794,
          "sentence_document_end": 805,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9002f985778b399a4574",
          "document_start": 806,
          "document_end": 838,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 806,
          "end": 838,
          "chunk_start": 806,
          "chunk_end": 838,
          "sentence_document_start": 806,
          "sentence_document_end": 838,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d0242140c6b99a72d4e1",
          "document_start": 840,
          "document_end": 929,
          "text": "碰撞力学方法将碰撞过程看作是一个随时间连续变化的动力学过程，分为压缩和释放两个阶段，考虑了碰撞体的弹性和塑性变形，提出并完善了一系列碰撞力与穿透距离、穿透速度变化关系的数学模型。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 840,
          "end": 929,
          "chunk_start": 840,
          "chunk_end": 929,
          "sentence_document_start": 840,
          "sentence_document_end": 929,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8676b357d9cec37a02f9",
          "document_start": 929,
          "document_end": 981,
          "text": "对于低速碰撞，能量损失主要是通过考虑材料阻尼特性来计算，然而高速碰撞时，塑性变形成为能量损失的主要因素。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 929,
          "end": 981,
          "chunk_start": 929,
          "chunk_end": 981,
          "sentence_document_start": 929,
          "sentence_document_end": 981,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_81bb1fe90a8ec9b0feba",
          "document_start": 981,
          "document_end": 995,
          "text": "在这里主要讨论低速碰撞问题。",
          "section_id": "section_4b357457e1bb",
          "start": 981,
          "end": 995,
          "chunk_start": 981,
          "chunk_end": 995,
          "sentence_document_start": 981,
          "sentence_document_end": 995,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
